QUERY NAME: JF FZ2000 mthly
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT ProjectMonthFinal.Project, ProjectMonthFinal.MonthNo, ProjectMonthFinal.Subcontracts, ProjectMonthFinal.TimeCosts, ProjectMonthFinal.TransferCosts, ProjectMonthFinal.TotalCost
FROM ProjectMonthFinal
WHERE (((ProjectMonthFinal.Project)="fz2000"));

